  "notes": [
    "DRAFT: a skeleton from the world database export of map 289 (tools/dungeongen, spec tools/dungeongen/plans.json). The boss order is the usual clear order, the packs are the spawn clusters nearest each boss; walls, doors, stairs and events are unknown to it. Not mapped, not live-checked: do the GM-invisible mapping walk and correct the route before the first run (AUTO-IMPROVE step 0); dungeon_run refuses it without allow_draft.",
    "A wait_for on a door a lever or key opens needs timeout_s 60 (the default): a linked door can open 30 s after the use.",
    "Needs: Viewing Room Key (GO_VIEWING_ROOM_DOOR) and the boss gates (GO_GATE_MALICIA, GO_GATE_THEOLEN, GO_GATE_POLKELT, GO_GATE_RAVENIAN, GO_GATE_ILLUCIA, GO_GATE_BAROV, GO_GATE_GANDLING); the gates open as the Barovs fall",
    "Needs: Kirtonos the Herald is summoned at the brazier (GO_BRAZIER_KIRTONOS, GO_GATE_KIRTONOS), optional",
    "Needs: Darkmaster Gandling (1853) has no spawn row: he appears after the Barov wing",
    "Needs: Dawn's Gambit (GO_DAWN_S_GAMBIT) for Vectus and Marduk Blackpool; Doctor Theolen Krastinov carries npc_flags (questgiver) until the fight",
    "Skeleton Key / lockpicking for the entrance chests is not modelled."
